  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After marvelling to Kaiwen at Chun Yuqiao's bold crisis-PR instincts, Stella comes face-to-face in her office with sheepish reporter Bianbian. Listen to the final conversation of Episode 6 first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "危机公关我还巴巴地做什么方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "淳于乔路子太野了，我看我还是改行算了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "姐姐，咱不能够啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在连人都成淳于乔的人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，幸会啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我就是传说中的边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "凯文说你给星天解决了那件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这也算省了我公关部的麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他还让我照应你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "危机公关我还巴巴地做什么方案？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did I even bother drafting crisis-PR plans?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "淳于乔路子太野了，我看我还是改行算了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao's moves are too wild—I think I might as well change careers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "姐姐，咱不能够啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Stella, we could never lose you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在连人都成淳于乔的人了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now everyone has practically been won over to Chun Yuqiao's side.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，幸会啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Stella, charmed to meet you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我就是传说中的边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am the legendary Bianbian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "凯文说你给星天解决了那件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen says you helped Xingtian resolve that commentator affair.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这也算省了我公关部的麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I suppose that saved my PR department some trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他还让我照应你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And he even asked me to look after you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did he stop to think that you were the one who caused us trouble in the first place?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Going by what you mean, am I not going to get this feature story written after all?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "危机公关我还巴巴地做什么方案？",
      "gap": 0.5
