    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他还让我照应你。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With Xin Huimei signed and Bianbian nervously reporting to Stella, Unit One wins the round—though fresh company tests already loom ahead. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
